  "system": {
    "identifier": "akimichi-full-body-expansion",
    "description": "<p>You temporarily expand your entire body growing in size for the duration as you become Large.</p>\n<p>While large, you gain the following benefits:</p>\n<p>Advantage on Strength ability checks and saving throws.</p>\n<p>Unarmed and Weapon damage you deal is increased by 1d6.</p>\n<p>Expansion Crash. Your unarmed and weapon damage die increase by 1 step.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the Chakra cost of this jutsu by 3. If this jutsu is cast at A-Rank or higher increase the calorie cost by +1 and your size instead becomes Huge and the bonus damage becomes 2d6.</p>",
